        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Larry Gagosian, Steve Dildarian\n- Organizations: Gagosian Gallery, HBO\n- Products: The Life & Times of Tim\n- Places: Nathaniel L. McCready House\n\nFacts:\n- Larry Gagosian was born on April 19, 1945.\n- Larry Gagosian is an Armenian American art dealer.\n- Larry Gagosian owns the Gagosian Gallery chain of art galleries.\n- Steve Dildarian was born on November 3, 1969.\n- Steve Dildarian is an American former advertising copywriter.\n- From 2008 to 2012, Steve Dildarian was the creator, writer, producer, and voice of Tim in HBO's animated television series The Life & Times of Tim.\n- In 2011, Larry Gagosian purchased the Nathaniel L. McCready House and demolished the mansion's interior.",
